graph TD
    A[Environmental Change] --> B{Adaptation Type?}
    B -->|Temperature| C[Temperature Adaptation]
    B -->|pH| D[pH Adaptation]
    B -->|Osmolarity| E[Osmotic Adaptation]
    B -->|Pressure| F[Pressure Adaptation]
    
    C --> G[Thermal Response]
    G --> H[Protein Adaptation]
    H --> I[Temperature Adaptation Complete]
    
    D --> J[Acid-Base Response]
    J --> K[pH Homeostasis]
    K --> L[pH Adaptation Complete]
    
    E --> M[Osmotic Response]
    M --> N[Osmolyte Synthesis]
    N --> O[Osmotic Adaptation Complete]
    
    F --> P[Pressure Response]
    P --> Q[Pressure Adaptation]
    Q --> R[Pressure Adaptation Complete]
    
    I --> S[Environmental Adaptation Complete]
    L --> S
    O --> S
    R --> S
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> T[Stress Response]
    T --> U[Adaptation Mechanisms]
    U --> V[Environmental Adaptation]
    V --> S
    
    %% Regulation
    S --> W[Adaptation Status]
    W --> X{Environment Stable?}
    X -->|Yes| Y[Adaptation Maintenance]
    X -->|No| Z[Adaptation Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    AA[Thermal Response Proteins] --> G
    BB[pH Response Proteins] --> J
    CC[Osmotic Response Proteins] --> M
    DD[Pressure Response Proteins] --> P
    EE[Adaptation Factors] --> U
    FF[Environmental Sensors] --> A
    
